      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "What's Wrong With This Code?"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "content": "1SELECT SUM(salary) \n2FROM Employees AS salary_expense;"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, the salary_expense alias is not specified in the SELECT clause."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "While retrieving a column as an alias, we must use it on the same line as the SELECT clause."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "How to Fix It?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Update the SELECT clause to include the correct alias:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "content": "1SELECT SUM(salary) AS salary_expense \n2FROM Employees;"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
    },
